sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Connector
  participant K as Keycloak (harbourline realm)
  participant H as Harbourline API
  C->>K: POST /token (client_id + client_secret)
  K-->>C: access token, valid 300s (aud: harbourline-api, scopes)
  Note over C: Cache it. Renew 30s before it expires.
  C->>H: GET /v1/products (Authorization: Bearer token)
  H->>K: fetch signing keys (cached)
  Note over H: Check signature, issuer, expiry,<br/>audience and the scope this route needs
  H-->>C: 200 products
  Note over C,H: If Harbourline ever answers 401...
  C->>H: POST /v1/orders
  H-->>C: 401 token_expired
  C->>K: POST /token (one fresh token)
  K-->>C: new access token
  C->>H: POST /v1/orders (retry once)
  H-->>C: 201 created
